<title>UAE: UNITED ARAB EMIRATES GOVERNMENT LIST.</title>
<headline>UNITED ARAB EMIRATES GOVERNMENT LIST.</headline>
<text>
<p>UNITED ARAB EMIRATES GOVERNMENT LIST (961202)</p>
<p>  President (Re-elected 2 Dec 96)</p>
